Source and attribution
-----------------------
These files are derived from Amazon Redset, released by Amazon under
CC BY-NC 4.0:

  A. van Renen et al., "Why TPC Is Not Enough: An Analysis of the Amazon
  Redshift Fleet," Proceedings of the VLDB Endowment, vol. 17, no. 11,
  pp. 3694-3706, 2024.
  Dataset: https://github.com/amazon-science/redset

Redset is a busy-ness-weighted sample, and an instance does not necessarily
correspond to a single customer. Treat these partitions as a realistic but
partial view of the fleet, not a census.

Note on code
------------
This data license applies only to the partition files under partitions/. The
source code in this repository (under code/) is licensed separately under the
MIT license; see the top-level LICENSE file.
